factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The reel_script and caption say the IG 'came to Karur' and the slides say 'IG Balakrishnan inspected' — the article says Trichy Central Zone IG Balakrishnan inspected the SP office, which is consistent, but the reel_script's 'கரூர் வந்தார்' adds an unsupported detail of travel to Karur, though minor.
  The reel_script says the DIG CB Chakravarthy inspection was 'முன்நாள்' (day before yesterday) in the spoken text but the slides say 'முன்நாள் டி.ஐ.ஜி.' while the article says 'நேற்று முன்தினம' — the wording is awkward Tamil ('முன்நாள்' is not a clear time expression) and the caption/reel use it as a noun without clear meaning.
  The reel_script states that 'ஆய்வு செய்தார்' on 'குற்ற வழக்கு விபரங்கள், தண்டனை விபரங்கள்' — acceptable, but the reel_script omits the DIG's advice/recommendations (the article says he gave various suggestions), a key fact missing from the reel_script.
  The slides_spec line 'இடைத்தேர்தல் பணிகள் களைகட்ட தொடங்கியது' is presented as an advice item under 'அறிவுரை', mixing the outcome of the inspection (preparations becoming busy) with the IG's instructions, combining two different facts in one list.
  The slides_spec line 'கரூர் எஸ்.பி. அலுவலகத்தில் நடந்தது' under 'அதிகாரிகள் வருகை' is a vague, ungrammatical-sounding fragment that does not clearly state what happened there.
